        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 09-S7, Stainless Steel Square Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Fusion Hardware, the 09-S7 modern Square Knobset is made out of stainless steel and is available with either a brushed or polished finish. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors with either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. This Stainless Steel Square Knob with Matching Rosette is easy to install and will look awesome in any contemporary setting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 09-S7 2040 Knob with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Stainless Steel Square Knob and Rosette 09 S7:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob: 2-1/16\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Knob projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Square Knob with Matching Rosette, Fusion 09-S7",
                "description": "Fusion 09-S7, Stainless Steel Square Knob with Matching Rosette - Made by Fusion Hardware, the 09-S7 modern Square Knobset is made out of stainless steel and is available with either a brushed or polished finish. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors with either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. This Stainless Steel Square Knob with Matching Rosette is easy to install and will look awesome in any contemporary setting.",
